# The overlays from the title and back (Practice setup, Help & Rules, Settings, Profile & Scores with a
# board tab, Journey with its locked stages, Challenges), then a Practice table: the countdown, Escape to
# pause and Resume, a roll, a hold by key and by the die button, the camera key, the Table drawer, Leave
# table cancelled, Settings from the pause menu and back (the top bar's Settings and the tray's and Table drawer's
# Leave table come first in build order, hence #2 / #3), and a forfeit from the pause menu to its results.
until 300 Five Dice
frames 150
expect Content v1 · Rules v1
expect 0 / 40 stages cleared
save title
